     'Before sharing a finished piece, do three separate passes. First, structure: does every scene move the story? Cut what does not. '
     'Second, sentences: strengthen verbs, remove repetition, vary rhythm. Third, proofreading: spelling, punctuation and consistency of names, ages and dates. '
